{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing plugin dispatch-order contract.** Invocation-end hooks previously ran in registration order, so reversing them globally changes observable behavior for existing multi-plugin configurations and can invert established flush or cleanup dependencies. Retain legacy ordering, or introduce an explicit scoped-cleanup mechanism whose participants opt into reverse unwinding.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77L0jf","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"cb0529bf9d22f5e529360b02fc53d2fbd063cd065c69bbd1c50d60afe52dfbf3","observation_id":"aro_v1_zmcstp45el26kkjwbmbpyu6s7p","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-08T03:06:57Z","review_id":"arr_v1_c2usoqym5ckwbtcjab5hzdhwpt","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"4cc0f356ca4356dd098c503ca66555819d92391f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_qyjxzltl2pfzyvkm6zkbuq3h6r","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T03:06:57Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
